  m_text: '--Demo Early Access-- v0.27


    Welcome to the Early Access demo of
    "Black Breath". This game is in an early stage of development and will feature
    bugs, placeholder assets, and lack of content.


    This Demo will showcase
    a complete basic gameplay loop in one of the campaign zones "The Burning Forest".


    Saving
    game progress and additional options are currently not allowed.


    Please,
    remember to give us your Feedback!'
